    old "Hypnosis. They've implanted a false second personality into her to control and manipulate her.{#ch12_d_002}"
    new "デルフリンガー：催眠魔法だな。人間に仮想の別人格を刷り込んで、その人間を支配し操るんだ。"

    old "And one more thing. The girl's physical abilities are boosted by another suggestion or spell.{#ch12_d_003}"
    new "デルフリンガー：それともうひとつ。あの娘は、別の暗示か魔法で肉体能力も強化されてるな。"

    old "Unbelievable… Haruna…{#ch12_s_046}"
