    old "Still going. It's actually getting more intense, if anything.{#ch12_l_048}"
    new "ルイズ：まだ、続いているわ。むしろ激しさを増していると言ったほうがいいでしょうね。"

    old "Apparently Reconquista used the repair work after the bombings to slip in soldiers and plant cannons…{#ch12_l_049}"
